# ODNProcServ.edl: start/stop/status of the xspress IOC's procServ, served by
# a procServControl IOC with P=XSPRESS (opened from the ODNProcServ button on
# xspressTop.edl). Only the IOC row: the Odin services do not run under
# procServ.
